note ABI580.173.02 measured by tests/nvrm_struct_layout.c against vendor headers.
note Only the fields filled or consumed by nvrm.c are projected; all other request bytes zero.
note Kinds: 1 ID 2 DEVICE 3 SUBDEVICE 4 VIRTUAL 5 GPU_INFO_V2 6 GR_GET
note 7 CLASSLIST 8 VASPACE 9 GID 10 MEMORY 11 CHANNEL 12 CHGROUP
note 13 CTXSHARE 14 TOKEN 15 SCHEDULE 16 CARD_TABLE 17 GR_INFO.
note mode 0 encode, 1 decode scalar, 2 size, 3 offset, 4 width, 5 count.
note For mode1 a[0]=field a[1]=record index (CARD_TABLE or GPU_INFO_V2).
note GID data is byte fields 3..258, after index/flags/length; not host-endian u64 chunks.
note CARD_TABLE mode0 zeroes all records then fills record zero from a; other records are driver output.
